<mxCell id="device-rules" value="Persistence rules
• One row per note; expense rows, checklist items and reminder settings are JSON inside notes.content.
• Ordinary reads exclude soft-deleted rows. Trash is an intentional exception.
• folders/notes have ISO timestamps and app-generated base-36 IDs.
• Password protection gates UI access; note content stays plaintext.
• Theme, note colours/backgrounds, notification registrations and sync preferences are device-local." vertex="1" parent="1" data-model-id="device-rules" data-source-path="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;spacing=12;align=left;"><mxGeometry x="650" y="850" width="1020" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
