<mxCell id="storage-links" value="Private image Storage
Bucket: note-attachments (private JPEG files).
note_attachments.storage_path and reservation.storage_path match storage.objects.name (no FK).
Private target: (owner_id, local_note_id) matches private_notes logically (no FK).
Pro funds new images/uploads; members must have editor + lease permission.
Signed download URLs expire; metadata contains no image bytes." vertex="1" parent="1" data-model-id="storage-links" data-source-path="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;spacing=12;align=left;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1130" width="920" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="sharing-rules" value="Collaboration rules
Owner needs unexpired Plus/Pro; invitees can be Free. Offline/expired-owner incoming notes stay hidden; caches/memberships are retained.
Solid = actual FK (grouped labels name parallel FKs). Subscriptions are zero-or-one per profile; other child sets are zero-or-many.
PK/FK fields are marked in bold. auth.users is a partial managed-table reference." vertex="1" parent="1" data-model-id="sharing-rules" data-source-path="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;spacing=12;align=left;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1420" width="1630" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
